abstract: >-
  Mind the Gap is an algorithm for detecting gaps in
  building footprints datasets, with a preference for
  finding the rectangular-shaped gaps caused by missing
  imagery tiles. It works best on country-sized datasets or
  smaller, or larger datasets divided into smaller chunks.
